    <!-- ════ About screen ════ -->
    <string name="about_title">About PhoneLab</string>
    <string name="about_body">PhoneLab gives you full real-time visibility into your device\'s hardware.\n\n✅  Live readings from every hardware sensor, with gauges\n✅  8 thermal zones, battery health and charging power\n✅  Device check: touch, display, speaker, mic and more, with a shareable report\n✅  Tools: bubble level, compass calibration, metal detector, vibration analyzer\n✅  Custom alerts when a reading crosses your threshold\n✅  Benchmark, spec export (text / JSON) and sensor recording (CSV)\n✅  Home-screen widget, Quick Settings tile, Material You colors\n✅  Your sensor data never leaves your device</string>
